# Trivy ignores for the filesystem scan (.github/workflows/ci.yml; the image scan reads
# .trivyignore-images). Each entry is a recorded exception in
# docs/compliance/vulnerability-exceptions.md and expires on its review date. --ignore-unfixed hides
# advisories with no fix whatever their date, so scripts/check-vulnerability-exceptions.mjs fails
# CI once a review date has passed, or when this file, the record and pnpm's ignoreGhsas differ.
# Trivy may report either id. Configuration checks (AVD ids) are ignored inline in the Terraform,
# next to the resource, never here.

# decode-uri-component 0.2.2 via expo-router > query-string@7 (mobile only). The code is patched
# (patches/decode-uri-component@0.2.2.patch); Trivy still matches 0.2.2 by its version (H-397)
